{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果首款摺疊屏手機iPhone Duo將於明天（16日）晚8時開售，下周五（23日）正式發貨。</p><p>該機型在電商平台京東的預約搶購人數，截至今晚已突破229萬，起售價15,999元（人民幣，下同）。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T14:20:38.888122+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T14:04:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T08:37:37.814248+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T14:17:49.255223+00:00","content_hash":"7d73847b8e0254e322b0d79c59c39692e64e154cb8e3b8979b5862464cacd9ca","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}